      "migration": "expand, migrate consumers, then contract, with a coordinated DROP ... CASCADE",
      "rule": "append-only",
      "shape_change": "A relation that becomes a loader-written table is replaced by a guarded migration that drops the view only when one is still there, in the same pass that creates the table. The published column names survive the change; the key columns are retyped from character varying to text, which psycopg returns identically."
